  "prompts": [
    "A fixed learning rate can keep improving the training metric after held-out accuracy levels off.",
    "Show a fixed rate plateau with a growing training heldout gap.",
    "Compare training and held-out accuracy while the learning rate stays constant.",
    "Why can training loss fall after held-out accuracy reaches a plateau?",
    "Plot a constant-rate history with training loss separate from both accuracies.",
    "Check training and held-out predictions when an accuracy gap first appears."
  ],
  "paraphrases": [
    "Show a fixed rate plateau with a growing training heldout gap.",
